#. module: odoo_website_helpdesk
#: model:mail.template,body_html:odoo_website_helpdesk.ticket_approved
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    i think your Problem is Solved.\n"
"                    Your Ticket\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"></t>\n"
